OL,3,AGlobal nature talks reach deal but
OL,4,Amoney remains an issue
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn Armenia's capital this week a fight
OL,7,Fbetween politicians broke out - not the
OL,8,Fmass brawl in its parliament that was
OL,9,Fso widely documented on social media -
OL,10,Fbut between delegates from nearly 200
OL,11,Fcountries.
OL,13,FThe world's nations have been gathered
OL,14,Fin Yerevan for nearly two weeks
OL,15,Fnegotiating, and arguing, over a new
OL,16,Fagreement on nature.
OL,18,FEarly on Saturday morning, hours after
OL,19,Ftalks were due to finish, they finally
OL,20,Fagreed the key parts of a new action
OL,21,Fplan.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
